    {
      "id": "kwFnyT8z59AAuNXGSxxpH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 450.6666666666663,
      "y": 225.0555555555555,
      "width": 879,
      "height": 625,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "af",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1575314787,
      "version": 298,
      "versionNonce": 955137421,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785848644942,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "// IQueryable<T>：延迟执行，仅拼接查询表达式，**不会发送SQL访问数据库**\nIQueryable<Book> query = db.Books.Where(b => b.Price > 10); \n\n// -------------------- 以下4种情况才会真正执行SQL，访问数据库 --------------------\n\n// 1. foreach 枚举遍历，触发数据库查询\nforeach (var book in query)\n{\n    \n}\n\n// 2. 调用集合转换方法 ToList/ToListAsync/ToArray/ToDictionary，触发执行\nvar bookList = await db.Books.Where(b => b.Price > 10).ToListAsync();\n\n// 3. 查询最外层使用单值LINQ方法 First/Any/Count/Single，触发执行\nbool exists = await db.Books.AnyAsync(b => b.Id == 1);\nvar firstBook = await db.Books.FirstOrDefaultAsync();\n\n// 4. EF Core专属 LoadAsync，无返回值，数据加载到DbContext跟踪器，触发执行\nawait db.Books.Where(b => b.Price > 10).LoadAsync();\n\n\n// ❗注意：仅链式调用 Where / OrderBy / Select，只是继续拼接查询，**不会执行SQL**\nvar tempQuery = db.Books.Where(b => b.Price > 10).OrderBy(b => b.Name); \n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "// IQueryable<T>：延迟执行，仅拼接查询表达式，**不会发送SQL访问数据库**\nIQueryable<Book> query = db.Books.Where(b => b.Price > 10); \n\n// -------------------- 以下4种情况才会真正执行SQL，访问数据库 --------------------\n\n// 1. foreach 枚举遍历，触发数据库查询\nforeach (var book in query)\n{\n    \n}\n\n// 2. 调用集合转换方法 ToList/ToListAsync/ToArray/ToDictionary，触发执行\nvar bookList = await db.Books.Where(b => b.Price > 10).ToListAsync();\n\n// 3. 查询最外层使用单值LINQ方法 First/Any/Count/Single，触发执行\nbool exists = await db.Books.AnyAsync(b => b.Id == 1);\nvar firstBook = await db.Books.FirstOrDefaultAsync();\n\n// 4. EF Core专属 LoadAsync，无返回值，数据加载到DbContext跟踪器，触发执行\nawait db.Books.Where(b => b.Price > 10).LoadAsync();\n\n\n// ❗注意：仅链式调用 Where / OrderBy / Select，只是继续拼接查询，**不会执行SQL**\nvar tempQuery = db.Books.Where(b => b.Price > 10).OrderBy(b => b.Name); \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
