    {
      "id": "-0QW9FxFe7oB4j3r0AS1v",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 457.61111111111074,
      "y": 963.5000000000001,
      "width": 727,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "am",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 808745901,
      "version": 113,
      "versionNonce": 484353059,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785849724434,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Eager 预先加载：Include，1次SQL join拿到主+关联数据\n\n2. Explicit 显式加载：Entry().Collection().LoadAsync()，手动分多次SQL\n\n3. Select 投影加载：Select()，只取需要字段，投影匿名/DTO，不加载完整实体\n\n4. Lazy 延迟加载：访问导航属性时自动偷偷查库，容易N+1查询",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Eager 预先加载：Include，1次SQL join拿到主+关联数据\n\n2. Explicit 显式加载：Entry().Collection().LoadAsync()，手动分多次SQL\n\n3. Select 投影加载：Select()，只取需要字段，投影匿名/DTO，不加载完整实体\n\n4. Lazy 延迟加载：访问导航属性时自动偷偷查库，容易N+1查询",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
